WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:03.170
Queen's Blade.

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.570
Everything is in accordance with the Queen's will.

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:09.980
The warriors are still unaware of the time, stage, or opponent of their next battle.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.840
Sometimes fate is ironic; it plays tricks on the warriors and bewilders them.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.640
Sorry, there aren't any vacancies. Try another inn.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.130
No luck here, either?

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:35.730
I thought I could rest before the Queen's Blade battles begin, but...

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.110
Hey! Open up!

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:44.530
Hey, aren't you clearing the room too forcibly?

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:46.100
Not at all!

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:51.940
I would go to any lengths to give shelter to a fighter participating in Queen's Blade,

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.870
so I must drive them out.

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:56.830
Hey! Aren't you going to open up?!

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:59.490
What is it? You sure are noisy.

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:03.510
This room is reserved for participants of Queen's Blade!

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:05.540
You must leave at once-

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:10.250
Oh yeah, I forgot to mention something.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:14.130
I'm also entering Queen's Blade.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:15.910
Echidna?

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:21.860
Oh, and I was wondering who it could be.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:32.070
The sky will not fall, the sea will not dry, and the earth will not split.

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:38.700
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:52.130
Just as I can see no end to this sky,

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:59.050
I inherit the will and strength that will exist forever.

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:05.390
With each person carrying different feelings in their heart,

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:13.110
When the time comes, they will fulfill their promise with that special someone.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:17.530
In order to become

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:22.700
the chosen ruler of this world,

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:26.790
I will shake off any pain I feel.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:34.050
The sky will not fall, the sea will not drought, and the earth will not split.

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:40.090
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:47.100
No one shall stop me on my path.

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:02.070
Eh? You'll also be enter Queen's Blade?

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:08.210
Well, I thought becoming the Queen wouldn't be so bad, or something like that.

00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:11.300
So there are reasons like that, too.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.960
But I'm glad you're doing well.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:18.860
I haven't seen you ever since that special training.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:22.350
Speaking of that, we still haven't done our special night training yet.

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:27.900
Cute, as always.

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:31.870
Um... this is...

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:34.870
A free service from this inn.

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:38.630
Not just one, but two distinguished warriors are staying here...

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:41.070
I couldn't be happier.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:43.530
Well then, I'll take some sake, too.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:45.760
Yes! Right away!

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:51.160
Right after hearing we're entering Queen's Blade, he changed so much.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:56.090
Well, men always have an unexpected side to them.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:57.930
An unexpected side?

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:10.800
Geez, we got lost while sightseeing in the city, and now this rain...

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:11.930
We're so unlucky.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:16.970
But it isn't so bad to get soaked like this every once in a while, don't you agree?

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:21.320
Listen, you're going to be fighting in Queen's Blade from here on out.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:23.490
What would you do if you caught a cold now?

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:26.370
You worry too much, Shizuka-san.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.600
Listen to me Tomoe-sama.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:30.870
Something's strange about that Queen.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:36.020
Aldra isn't a normal opponent.
I can sense an evil power from her.

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.220
I told you so...

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:57.480
Excuse us for intruding-

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:01.070
We got a little lost.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:04.970
We were thinking it might be nice if we could take shelter from the rain here...

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:07.310
That's terrible.

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:12.410
Helping those who have become lost is one of the duties of God's messengers.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:19.670
Excuse me. I only have these kinds of clothes prepared.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:23.880
Not at all, your holy garments feel nice too.

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:27.010
You even prepared a meal prepared for us.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.770
How can I express my gratitude?

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:31.980
Thanks for the food!

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:33.900
Melpha, I'm hungry!

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:35.480
Yes, right away!

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:36.690
Nanael-san?

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:39.850
Stupid angel!

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:41.980
Oh, if it isn't Tomoe and Shizuka?

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:46.280
Oh, you two are acquaintances of the great archangel?

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:47.450
Arch!

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:48.490
angel!

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.410
sama!

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:57.960
We're in luck, aren't we, Tomoe-sama?

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.560
We've met such a kind person.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:01.170
Yes.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:05.360
Not at all. This mission has been bestowed upon me by God.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:09.720
It is my duty to propagate the doctrines of our merciful God.

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:12.160
Splendid, splendid.

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:15.100
Aside from her adoring that stupid angel.

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:23.150
If I attain victory through Queen's Blade, surely I can aid many more stray people.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:24.780
Queen's Blade?

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.810
So that's how it was.

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:32.870
Tomoe-sama is also participating in Queen's Blade.

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:36.300
Yes. I'm surprised, however.

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:42.290
You must think it's strange that someone like me,
a messenger of God, is entering Queen's Blade, right?

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:44.660
No, that isn't what I meant.

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:48.470
The western warriors I have met until now are completely different.

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:55.650
The appearance of those warriors... how should I put this?

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:59.110
They expose far too much skin...

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:04.550
to the point that I am hesitant to looks straight at them.

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:09.700
Compared to them, what modest garments you have!

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:17.110
I'm relieved to know that there are
other properly dressed warriors here.

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:19.020
Don't you agree, Shizuka-san?

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:20.710
Ah... yeah.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.370
Thank you very much.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:27.670
However, I do not think you should judge people by outer appearances alone.

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:33.370
I'm sure that their true essence lies within them.

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:35.600
Take Her Majesty the Queen, for example...

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:41.190
Although you wouldn't imagine it from her
{very }young {outwards }appearance, she possesses great strength{power}.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:44.320
I cannot even fathom the power that lies within her.

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:49.740
However, I must defeat Aldra, no matter the cost.

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.240
Everything is for the sake of Hinomoto.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:56.390
You undoubtedly have a great motivation.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:58.880
It's about time to go home, Tomoe-sama.

00:07:58.880 --> 00:08:00.830
We don't have to be in such a rush.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.580
The rain has already stopped.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.050
Shizuka-san.

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:10.060
Hot, hot, hot!

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:16.390
Don't touch me so casually, scum.

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.400
Do you understand what you've done?{you something good understand?}

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:26.360
I'm sorry!{excuse/apology + gibberish}

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:28.530
But I'm not the one who...

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:31.110
Are you talking back to me?

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.530
I'm sorry.

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:37.050
Did you break something again? You're hopeless.

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:38.740
No, it wasn't me...

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:41.910
You're just a servant. Don't talk back to me!

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:45.190
I'm very sorry, Elina-sama.

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:47.540
No dinner for you today!

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:02.310
Don't cry in the middle of the road. You're in my way!

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:06.230
E-Elina?

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:09.780
Why is Elina of the Vance family here?

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:16.160
Funikura-sama, {please}forgive me!{I'm sorry}

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:21.000
That's it...

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:27.710
With this power, I'll become Queen and
triumph over those other superior humans...

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:34.810
The security is pretty light, huh?

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:39.020
When inviting a guest, security isn't necessary.

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:44.680
I've been waiting for you.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.850
What? What's the meaning of this?

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:52.290
Sorry, but I don't have time to go along with your games.

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:54.350
I'll just defeat you here.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:58.660
And after that, I'll take your treasure!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:09:58.660
And after that, I'll take your treasure!

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:11.090
I won't fight with you.

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:15.120
I've come up with some amusing combinations for Queen's Blade.

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:16.420
What?

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:21.640
What happens when close friends are forced to fight each other?

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:24.850
When people are placed in extreme situations...

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:30.070
they show the other side of their hearts.
The darkness they normally would not show.

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:33.200
Her Highness has pretty bad tastes, huh?

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:38.220
Suffering{pain}, hatred, and sorrow{grief}...

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:42.000
are all very beautiful. Don't you think they should be enjoyed?

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:43.900
I don't.

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:46.010
You should have it, as well...

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:49.090
Darkness lurking at the bottom of your heart.

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:55.920
I can't move my body.

00:10:56.300 --> 00:11:03.850
When the kindness you've held hidden turns into hatred, it gives birth to a strong force.

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:05.580
Risty.

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:08.840
No one else is more suited to become my vessel.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:12.060
What are you...

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:14.530
It is time to begin...

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:17.000
Queen's blade.

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:24.910
Eh?! Nanael-sama is entering, as well?

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:29.600
What is it?! Now I've woken up.

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:33.880
It is true that you're entering Queen's Blade as well, Nanael-sama?

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.090
How did you know?

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.020
You were talking in your sleep...

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:42.270
Well, about that... a lot of stuff happened...

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:50.480
Ah, damn it! I want to do it, I want to do it, I want to do it!

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:52.310
I really want to do it!

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:53.650
Would you stop already, Elina?

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:56.190
But I can't control myself anymore!

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:59.610
I want to make Leina mine right now!

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:04.800
Hey, Queen! Hurry up and start Queen's Blade!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:10.140
She's able to clearly express her thoughts
without hesitation, no matter what they are.

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:12.240
Come to think of it, Leina was like that, too.

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:15.520
They're sisters after all, eh?{of course, they're sisters, eh?}

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:17.350
Elina.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:30.640
Shizuka-san, why were you so angry earlier?

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.010
Like I was saying...

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:36.150
no matter how nice Melpha may be,
she's still a Queen's Blade participant.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:41.070
I am aware of that, but can't I reach
some kind of understanding with her?

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:45.500
That side of you will only be in the way of your battles from now on.

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:53.910
The chosen one for this round of Queen's Blade shall be:

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:55.870
Warrior Shrine Maiden, Tomoe.

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:26.370
When you are prepared, step through the gate.

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:29.900
Your Queen's Blade match awaits you there.

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:33.590
Shizuka-san, I....

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:36.410
I'll hear what you have to say when you get back.

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:39.540
Just think about winning for now.

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:42.500
I understand.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:44.950
I'll be going.

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:46.750
Best of luck.

00:13:55.970 --> 00:13:59.440
This is... the location of my Queen's Blade match.

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:06.600
Your first and last Queen's Blade battle will take place here.

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:08.450
Melpha-san? Don't tell me...

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:11.670
you were chosen as my opponent?

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:13.540
That seems to be the case.

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:17.590
This must also be God's great directive.

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:20.080
Well then, let us proceed.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:22.510
Come.

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:29.250
It would be nice if Leina were my opponent!

00:14:32.060 --> 00:14:33.310
I'm off!

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:42.680
Isn't this a place that fits me quite well?

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:46.160
Woah, it's hot! What is this place?

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:55.810
Oh, so it isn't Onee-chan. What a disappointment.

00:14:55.810 --> 00:15:00.120
H-hey, you don't remember me?

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:01.710
Huh? Who are you again?

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:03.590
It's me, Nyx!

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:06.630
A long time ago, you made me do so many awful things.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.840
I was a Vance servant. It's me, Nyx!

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:14.010
Huh? What's a former servant of our house doing here?

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.810
Of course, Queen's Blade...

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:21.100
Hey! Bring me something cold to drink.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:23.280
R-right away!

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:28.780
Hilarious. Servants will always be servants, won't they?

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:32.830
What?

00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:43.250
I'm sorry, Funikura-sama.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.920
W-what are you doing?

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:53.450
You'll be able to see it soon.
The darkness everyone holds in their heart.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:57.790
Come to think of it, Melpha isn't around. I'm hungry, really...

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:04.920
A book?

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.270
What's this?

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:08.370
Huh? An erotic book?{A porn book?}

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:18.870
Both of them are holding back.
The fight will go on forever like this.

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:22.500
It appears as though we won't reach our limits like this.

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:25.760
Tomoe-san, I'm going to get serious now.

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:29.090
Holy Pose...

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:32.170
What?

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:36.200
Confinement!{restraint, shackles, restriction, binding.. take your pick}

00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:46.810
Funikura-sama, please forgive me!

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:52.110
If you constrict me so much,
I won't be able to take it any more!

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:56.110
Hey, it's unbearably hot here!
This isn't the time to play around!

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:05.710
Hey! Are you listening?

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.590
What did you say?

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:15.680
Who do you think you're talking to, bitch?{whom talking to (rude)you}

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:19.390
Come. It's fine for you to release your dark side, as well.

00:17:21.130 --> 00:17:22.060
Stop it.

00:17:24.110 --> 00:17:29.190
The spirit of darkness sleeping in your heart.

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:39.650
Elina! I couldn't have wished for a better opponent.

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:44.460
I'll let loose the resentment I've built up towards your family here and now.

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:47.610
You're just a servant. I'm the one who should be giving orders here.

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:49.750
Hurry up and bring me some cold water!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.810
I told you to shut up!

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:55.840
Flame magic.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:59.260
I'm surprised you can use something like that, even though you're only a servant.

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:02.310
Servant this, servant that... just shut up already!

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:10.150
The darkness which lurks inside everyone's heart.

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:13.980
However, that is also a part of mankind's true form.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.040
Holy Pose! Penance!{austerities, mortification}

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:30.630
Ouch! Why in the world do you keep making such vulgar postures?

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:35.630
This is the etiquette as written in the scripture, therefore...

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:36.590
Scripture?

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:41.640
Melpha has a side like this, too? I like it.

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:47.650
By assuming these holy poses,
I can make use of this sacred power.

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:51.650
T-this is also is written in the scripture. It is God's own doctrine.

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:56.540
<i>This</i> is what she spoke of? The faith she is propagating?

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:06.370
She intends to propagate such shameless teachings to the world?

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:12.420
This is fine. It is meaningless to resist.

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:17.340
Everyone possesses a different face within the dark corner of their heart.

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:22.050
It is greedy, unsightly, and filled with madness.

00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:25.810
In the end, it is impossible to resist.

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:29.000
Everyone carries darkness in their heart, after all.

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:41.700
What one must possess, despite any circumstances...

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:43.620
is a strong heart.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:47.440
Melpha-san, it is as you have said.

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:52.740
On occasion, people may judge others based on appearances, disregarding their true character.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:54.080
However...

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.850
the answer to why outward appearances can often be perplexing...

00:19:56.850 --> 00:19:59.370
and the truth can leave you bewildered...

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:01.600
lies within our own inexperienced minds.

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:03.600
Please prepare yourself.

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:05.080
Holy Pose!

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:06.900
Divine Punishment!

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:15.980
In a situation such as this, one should
clear their mind of all mundane thoughts.

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.650
To victory!

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:27.980
Victor: Warrior Shrine Maiden, Tomoe.

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:47.310
Shizuka-san, what you said was correct.

00:20:47.310 --> 00:20:50.600
Before I realized it, I had forgotten...

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:54.230
my reason for fighting in these battles.

00:20:55.030 --> 00:20:56.480
I beg of you, please...

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:59.020
Good work. You won, didn't you?

00:20:59.020 --> 00:20:59.990
Tomoe-sama.

00:21:09.560 --> 00:21:13.040
Hey, what's wrong, little princess?

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:21.380
My tormented, unhappy self from those miserable days...

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:27.850
On the day I met with Funikura-sama, I was given great power.

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:30.570
Yes, I'm Nyx!

00:21:30.570 --> 00:21:35.230
I will burn this world's evil to ashes.
I'm the righteous Flame Master, Nyx.

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:48.620
I wonder in what a heart throbbing way I should make you mero - mero!

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:50.910
I'm having fun already just by thinking about it.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:54.410
I'll show you all that I'm the luckiest one in the end.

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:57.790
So everyone! Let's fight until we're all melted.

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:00.540
Swamp Witch.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.250
An eerie existence.

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:03.940
Well, we're all girls of the underworld.

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:05.920
Majestic orders.

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:07.550
Oh, Swamp Witch.

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:09.070
Such erotic actions.

00:22:09.070 --> 00:22:10.580
We'll truly show our love for you.

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:11.310
Yes.

00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:13.790
The three of us will all serve you.

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:14.540
Really?

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:15.430
Most likely.

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:17.630
Girls, let's all do our jobs properly.

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:20.610
Melona is oh so cute.

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:23.030
She's the bunny-eared shape shifter.

00:22:23.030 --> 00:22:25.440
Calm, serene, and logical,

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:27.860
You have no time to look away from me.

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:30.200
If you want me to play with you,

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:32.620
You can't do anything half-heartedly.

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:34.410
If you can't excite me,

00:22:34.410 --> 00:22:37.540
You're not fit to be my plaything.

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:42.450
Will you regret playing with me?

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:50.050
You're always hesitating to become my plaything.

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:52.890
I have an erotic body,

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:55.770
And can capture your heart with shape attacks.

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:57.850
I'm acidic and acidic,

00:22:57.850 --> 00:22:59.980
I can transform any time.

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.650
No matter who the person, I'll use my body,

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:05.280
And melt them down to their last remaining bit.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:07.400
I'm a being beyond your comprehension,

00:23:07.400 --> 00:23:10.070
These pink bunny-ears make me the best.

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:13.870
Hello!

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:19.210
Everyone, from here on out, I, Assassin of Innumerable Changes, Melona, will make you all mero-mero.

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:22.100
Right now it isn't my turn, so I thought I'd have free time but I guess that isn't the case, huh?

00:23:22.100 --> 00:23:26.760
Just a warning: I'll melt everyone with all I have, so prepare yourselves, okay?

00:23:26.760 --> 00:23:29.960
Well then, Elina Vance and Flame Master Nyx.

00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:32.610
Featuring revenge on a bully and burning flames,

00:23:32.610 --> 00:23:37.000
this tormenting, muddled, sopping battle of destiny is something worth seeing, right?

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:39.540
Next time: Flaming passion! Burning up connections.

00:23:39.540 --> 00:23:42.400
Between bonds and fate, which one is stronger?
